  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> Tech Rebuild Attachments</p>\n<p><em>A tweak to the output coils can allow for slimmer slugs to retain a marginal electric charge that reacts violently with cybernetic internals.</em></p>\n<p>When the modified Tech Rebuild is charged and makes a Ranged Attack that incurs a randomly-rolled Critical Injury (i.e., not from a Leg Aimed Shot), the target does not take any Bonus Damage (they still suffer the effect of the rolled Critical Injury) and instead suffers the effect of EMP Ammunition (CP:R, pg. 345). This does not overwrite the Attack dealing damage as normal. If the Attack would’ve already caused this effect (e.g., using Improved EMP Ammunition or a Microwaver), the target also suffers a -4 penalty to their Cybertech Check.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Attachment Mods).</em></p>"
